OL,3,ADutch court sentences man to life over
OL,4,ARwanda genocide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court in the Netherlands has
OL,7,Fsentenced a Dutch-Rwandan man to life
OL,8,Ffor his involvement in the 1994
OL,9,Fgenocide in Rwanda.
OL,11,FThe 66-year-old, named only as Eugene
OL,12,FN, was accused, among other things, of
OL,13,Fthrowing a hand grenade into a crowd of
OL,14,FTutsis who were seeking shelter in a
OL,15,Fstadium. He was convicted of war crimes
OL,16,Fand the crime of genocide, having acted
OL,17,Fwith "genocidal intent", the judge
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
