OL,3,ADutch court sentences man to life over
OL,4,ARwanda genocide
OL,5,
OL,6,FRwanda had sought his extradition in
OL,7,F2014 but the authorities in the
OL,8,FNetherlands then launched their own
OL,9,Finvestigation into N, who had become a
OL,10,FDutch citizen.
OL,12,FIn 100 days in April 1994, an estimated
OL,13,F800,000 ethnic Tutsis and politically
OL,14,Fmoderate Hutus people were killed by
OL,15,FHutu extremists.
